OL,3,GNEWSAMan held on suspicion of murdering
OL,4,Awoman, 79
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurdering a 79-year-old woman who was
OL,8,Ffound dead at a house.
OL,10,FThe woman was discovered in a house on
OL,11,FMyddleton Lane in Winwick, Warrington,
OL,12,Fat about 13:40 GMT on Wednesday,
OL,13,FCheshire Police said.
OL,15,FShe was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,16,FThe force said a post-mortem
OL,17,Fexamination had taken place but the
OL,18,Fcause of the woman's death was being
OL,19,F"withheld pending further enquiries".
